{{!
    @template tool_vae/document_page

    The one page document.php draws, between its header and its footer: the notification that the sub-system of
    competencies is off. Otherwise document.php sends a file and draws no page.

    The template holds no logic and no text of its own. It places one key of HTML made by the core (triple braces):
    noticehtml, a notification ($output->notification()) worded by tool_vae\output\document_page.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * noticehtml - HTML: the notification that the sub-system of competencies is off

    Example context (json):
    {
        "noticehtml": "<div class=\"alert alert-danger\">The competencies are not enabled on this site.</div>"
    }
}}
{{{noticehtml}}}
